    "question": "Cristobal read 15 more than three times the pages that Beatrix read. If Beatrix read 704 pages, how many more pages did Cristobal read?",
    "gold": "1423",
    "answer": "Cristobal read: 15 + 3 * 704 = <<15+3*704=2127>>2127 pages\n2127 - 704 = <<2127-704=1423>>1423 pages\nCristobal read 1423 more pages than Beatrix.\n#### 1423"
